=== Phase E: real-body cost vs threadgroup count (dummy buffers) ===
Each threadgroup reads 512x128 K and V rows = 262144 B, and 4 consecutive
threadgroups share one KV head, so `req` counts issued bytes and `uniq`
counts distinct bytes. Shipped sliding dispatch is K=32; R1 would be K=64.
